              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otalirahirra busa ibara lya MUKAMA Ruhanga wawe, habwokuba, Nyowe MUKAMA tindiihaho musango ogu anyakurahirra busa ibara lyange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
